s=s.replace('## 4. Discussion','### 3.3 Real-data case study — blocked, no biological results\n\nAn ENA metadata request for the herbal-beverage study recorded in `data/real/ena_study.tsv` returned public paired-end amplicon candidates. `data/real/manifest_sources.csv` records candidate runs and verification gaps. The study description mentions multiple ribosomal markers; run-level marker purity, product labels and a source publication remain TODO: verify. Candidates were therefore not promoted to `accessions.txt`.\n\nThe environment lacks Conda, R/DADA2, SRA Toolkit and BLAST. `make real` failed at preflight; the exact output is retained in `docs/real-preflight.log`. No raw reads were downloaded, no reference database was built, and no ASVs, species tables, verdicts or composition figures were produced for real data. Simulation validation remains the only biological-performance evidence. The new orchestration target is not an end-to-end validated pipeline.\n\n## 4. Discussion')
